Apply author ≠ judge to the actual work and skip ineligible substitutes. Steps 4 and 7 exclude Claude Fable 5.2, the ruling model, and every implementation author’s model. Step 7 also excludes the step-4 reviewer’s model. A fresh Opus instance may review or audit when eligible, independently of the director session. Disclose shared model or family with the director, the drafter, or another recorded seat, including the Sol owner and executor pairing and Astra’s prior rival-design consult. Preserve the DIRECTOR rule against rephrasing or resubmitting classifier-stopped content to the same provider. File stops and substitutions with the reason and attempt token count, or `not applicable` when no attempt ran. If no eligible seat remains, hold at that step and return to the owner. An exit audit awaiting an eligible seat leaves the results provisional.

