The director must disclose the increase from 10 to 20 targets with the corrected §7.7 rationale and binomial table. Steven’s separate decisions remain implementation authorization, SHA-first merge, and authorization of the single campaign, each default HOLD. No decision on a reliability standard is needed to freeze G43.
